flowchart TD
    %% Resume Analysis NLP Pipeline
    
    Start([User Uploads Resume]) --> FileCheck{File Type?}
    
    FileCheck -->|PDF| ExtractPDF["Extract Text<br/>PyMuPDF (fitz)<br/>Page-by-page extraction"]
    FileCheck -->|DOCX| ExtractDOCX["Extract Text<br/>python-docx<br/>Paragraph extraction"]
    FileCheck -->|Other| ErrorType["Unsupported Format<br/>Return Error"]
    
    ExtractPDF --> Clean["Clean Text<br/>• Remove extra whitespace<br/>• Normalize characters<br/>• Fix encoding"]
    ExtractDOCX --> Clean
    
    Clean --> SpacyLoad["Load spaCy Model<br/>en_core_web_sm<br/>Pre-trained NLP pipeline"]
    
    SpacyLoad --> Tokenize["Tokenization<br/>Split into words<br/>Handle contractions"]
    
    Tokenize --> POS["Part-of-Speech Tagging<br/>Identify NOUN, VERB, ADJ<br/>CNN-based tagger"]
    
    POS --> NER["Named Entity Recognition<br/>Extract:<br/>• PERSON (name)<br/>• ORG (companies)<br/>• DATE (employment)<br/>• GPE (locations)"]
    
    NER --> CustomNER["Custom Entity Extraction<br/>• Education (degrees)<br/>• Skills (technical)<br/>• Certifications<br/>• Tools/frameworks"]
    
    CustomNER --> SkillMatch["Skill Taxonomy Matching<br/>• Programming languages (24)<br/>• Frameworks (30+)<br/>• Databases (13)<br/>• Cloud tech (14+)"]
    
    SkillMatch --> Experience["Calculate Experience<br/>Regex patterns:<br/>• YYYY-YYYY<br/>• X years<br/>• Present/Current"]
    
    Experience --> SBERT["SBERT Embedding<br/>Model: all-MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>Resume → 384-dim vector"]
    
    SBERT --> Similarity["Semantic Similarity<br/>Compare with career profiles<br/>Cosine similarity"]
    
    Similarity --> GapAnalysis["Skill Gap Analysis<br/>Required vs Present<br/>Missing skills identification"]
    
    GapAnalysis --> Score["Calculate Scores<br/>• Overall match<br/>• Technical fit<br/>• Experience match<br/>• Skill coverage"]
    
    Score --> Report["Generate Report<br/>• Extracted info<br/>• Skill gaps<br/>• Recommendations<br/>• Match percentage"]
    
    Report --> End([Return Analysis])
    ErrorType --> End
    
